              "value": "Combat Grab"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The guard makes a melee Strike while keeping one hand free. If the Strike hits, they grab the target using their free hand. The creature remains grabbed until the end of the guard's next turn or until it Escapes, whichever comes first."
